{"version":1,"content":"<p>私隱專員公署昨日（26日）回覆傳媒查詢時表示，本月先後接獲香港航空、友和香港及百老滙資料外泄事故通報，至少有1600名客戶收到懷疑詐騙來電。</p><p>截至昨日，私隱公署就涉及上述事件共接獲23宗投訴及20宗查詢，目前已就事件展開調查。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:21:34.406991+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:43:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T02:18:18.843912+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:18:29.845141+00:00","content_hash":"1d6e3420e65899cf58081dd0f0e66d51d2d24c8ab6bc63ba1c7796e2f9ded06c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}